e_name": "screenshot02.png", "id": "1167270421589414", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473393425_1167270424922747_1907140739452079368_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=7-fqFmHFwUoQ7kNvwHob5TK&_nc_oc=Adoe8lkGyVZXFH5sJQOsIugSwxHbRszGr1438DIEX80nbIQltnhB3U1tUU8pxIR3gyI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af0zjzhPJoNa1dPyZndJ1KrQrR5bPKGpdAypJ6EFyCXQJQ&oe=69EB8779"}, {"file_name": "screenshot03.png", "id": "1320236425766559", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473392005_1320236429099892_7026969068655260219_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=6OoUYu5PDvUQ7kNvwFyTg42&_nc_oc=AdohvOeq76OeyYicCCq0LhRtY5xqul2Had3__Ynqq9_MiVYcADU6BSfuwbXBytwptRc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af2N9YA6mPXIDlZxCyMJ7nncA4Bti97XJPY8WzFmjPR2oA&oe=69EB5ED3"}, {"file_name": "screenshot04.png", "id": "1408931723813604", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391949_1408931727146937_1574658016866773147_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=V5VOK8r-1ngQ7kNvwGqJpe0&_nc_oc=AdpsoZb7rMFX1f98IGmPvGavDR2S5MkwkHMYfYcrHGA7u_FEFviVqFtSk2l1YTjESR0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af0sx09bpCrNvC2fBvnc9e85PuFA0oY8H4YIlIYsi7WA5w&oe=69EB6A7B"}, {"file_name": "screenshot05.png", "id": "418176134719567", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391998_418176138052900_6204508764481913331_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=4YCvzjKjGUAQ7kNvwGKdVUJ&_nc_oc=AdqwDmX-wkSz_MA1eGJuvoMOKk0YwAIA-Czw0mpdz8bpcYZf02hwSZP9_A1ERll-m4g&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af1oP7YCbmjyXrpGA1UDsaokv4hVOZ2aRvldvPrYxeRWUQ&oe=69EB6BCA"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "thumbnail2.png", "id": "1152565683077389", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391896_1152565689744055_250834400001166292_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=SE38edyojfkQ7kNvwGrw43h&_nc_oc=Ado_ETy3kWvW6i5LLKOITEcHmMJ4OQuZzlUm8AuXPnqgKRkL73aZOS6Fi4_9IkeMdE0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af3EIOU2u-GZjI9MFRRzpFzKiHDUA6Yds46f6wI8qGKs_w&oe=69EB54FE"}, "display_name": "Aerodrums 2", "keywords": [], "long_description": "This is the companion app for the Aerodrums 2 air drumming instrument (sold separately). Seamlessly connect to your Aerodrums 2 device over WiFi and see your drum kit materialize before your eyes. Choose your kit, jam to your favorite tunes, practice with a metronome, or record your performances. No Aerodrums 2? No problem! The app will let you play a basic drum kit in mixed reality using hand-tracking.\n\nAerodrums 2 is an expressive and versatile air drumming instrument. It is a standalone device that uses high-speed optical motion capture technology to accurately track the position of your drumsticks and feet in 3D. Unlike acoustic and traditional electronic drum sets, Aerodrums 2 is lightweight and portable, it is silent when used with headphones, and it takes up no space when not in use.\n\nPaired with Meta Quest headsets, Aerodrums 2 offers an unparalleled drumming experience. Passthrough mode and depth occlusion let you see your real hands and drumsticks while drumming, while hand-tracking is used to further improve stick-tracking accuracy.\n\nTo learn more about Aerodrums 2 visit aerodrums.com", "short_description": "This is the companion app for the Aerodrums 2 air drumming instrument (sold separately). Seamlessly connect to your Aerodrums 2 device over WiFi and see your drum kit materialize before your eyes. Choose your kit, jam to your favorite tunes, practice with a metronome, or record your performances. No Aerodrums 2? No problem! The app will let you play a basic drum kit in mixed reality using hand-tracking."}]}, "developer_name": "Aerodrums", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://aerodrums.com/privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_se